Description: Hayabusa v4.1+ eid-metrics (offline) (-U instead of --UTC)
Category: EventLogs
Author: KapeIR
Version: 1.0
Id: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-a012-3456789abc04
BinaryUrl: https://github.com/Yamato-Security/hayabusa/releases
ExportFormat: csv
Processors:
    -
        Executable: hayabusa\hayabusa.exe
        CommandLine: eid-metrics -d %sourceDirectory% -U -o %destinationDirectory%\hayabusa_event_statistics_v41.csv
        ExportFormat: csv

# Documentation
# Local copy for Hayabusa 4.1+ (stock hayabusa_EventStatistics.mkape still uses --UTC).
